    {
      "text": "Bar chart “FCA.1 – OPD visits per facility of total OPD visits in district in 2019 (%)”, sorted from highest to lowest. Lupara District Hospital accounts for about 39%, Lupara NGO Hospital about 17% and Health Centre A about 11%; the dispensaries each account for about 7% or less, with Dispensary G under 1%.",
